## Install

```sh
brew tap inquinity/tap
brew trust --tap inquinity/tap   # Homebrew 7 and later load casks only from taps you trust
brew install --cask inquinity/tap/desktop-name-manager
```

macOS 26 or later, Apple silicon only. The first run after installing needs a network connection once, for
macOS's notarization check; after that the tool works offline and never connects to the network.

